-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Nikasios%20lurched%20to%20one,his%20leg%2C%20severing%20it.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"walls-akros-2014-02-26-e14","era":null,"summary":"Pallas, injured, and the wounded Diocles and Nikasios stay to hold off more minotaurs while Leandros climbs out to warn Akros.","participants":["pallas","diocles","nikasios","leandros"],"location":"one-eyed-pass","importance":"major","page":"stories/walls-akros-2014-02-26","order":406,"story_date":"2014-02-26","storyline":"Born of the Gods","source":"wizards","paragraph":139,"quote":"Then more minotaurs poured into the canyon, and Leandros turned to climb the tumbled boulders.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Then%20more%20minotaurs%20poured,climb%20the%20tumbled%20boulders.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Walls of Akros","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-02-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/walls-akros-2014-02-26#:~:text=Then%20more%20minotaurs%20poured,climb%20the%20tumbled%20boulders.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Walls of Akros\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Feb 2014."}},{"id":"leandros-e0","era":{"date":"2020-01-24","era":"thb","label":"Theros Beyond Death"},"summary":"Leandros's squad is sent to investigate after Eumalos's squad misses its checkpoint, and kills a charging cyclops.","participants":["leandros","captain-kyrillos","nikasios","mnesos","pallas"],"location":"akros","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/leandros","order":1385,"story_date":"","storyline":"Theros","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"Leandros's squad was se